{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2441","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2441","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2441\",\"parent_revision\":\"ea12daf55ee6b3ea457ac45f7945e9e3783f831c587ef8421a7656c9162ee213\",\"root_revision\":\"ea12daf55ee6b3ea457ac45f7945e9e3783f831c587ef8421a7656c9162ee213\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDuring QG feature verification (P60d669b9/T2, issue #2279), three check_command design gaps were identified in the implementation plan Pdec8934d that will cause false results on the next TN verification run.\\n\\n**Gaps:**\\n- AC4/AC5: check_commands use `BACKLOG_BACKEND=beads` to test SAM task routing. The correct env var for SAM routing is `TASKBACKEND=beads` \u2014 `BACKLOG_BACKEND` controls the backlog provider, not the SAM task backend.\\n- AC6: check_command tests isolated `int()` failure on a non-integer string rather than the fixed hook behaviour (beads nanoid handling). The check validates the wrong thing.\\n\\n**Impact:** If TN verification is re-run against Pdec8934d without fixing these, AC4, AC5, and AC6 may produce misleading FAIL verdicts even when the implementation is correct.\\n\\n**Required action:** Amend Pdec8934d check_commands for AC4, AC5, and AC6 to test the actual implemented behaviour before any future TN verification run against this plan.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **fix tn check_command design gaps in pdec8934d (ac4/ac5/ac6)** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: QG feature verification P60d669b9/T2 non-blocking finding (2026-05-15)\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-15\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"5503a9f2b7197c0943ab8ed794b9e0e9092dbab9eface2171c32ff2bddb65c7f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCOX7g\"}"}